id: precedence-four-way-global-merge
category: precedence
images: rs-oracle10
targets: rhel10
key: kernel.randomize_va_space
xfail_issue: 
comment: all four search directories touch the same key with distinct basenames; alphabetic order 05<30<50<99 decides regardless of directory rank, so usr/lib's 99-d.conf (lowest-precedence dir) wins with the non-compliant value 0.
